1 NAME Taitu /Betul/
2 GIVN Taitu
2 _MARNM Betul
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Ba'eta le-Mariam Monastery
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Ethiopia
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1851
