2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was the daughter of Caleb D. Warren and Rachel Webster, also buried here.  .
2 CONT She married first Elias Delong, and they had 4 children: Diadama, Charlotte Isabel, Unnamed Daughter, and Leonora E. DeLong. .
2 CONT She married second John R. New, also buried here. Their children were Lucy A. New (m William Clark), buried Hampton Hill, and Veranus Williams New, buried in Yorktown National Cemetery, Tomb No. 1399.  . 
