2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Pliny (Pliney) Price Warren shares a stone with his son Asa and Asa's wife Mary. Pliny was the son of revolutionary War Soldier Caleb Dennis Warren. Pliny's first wife Betsy Elizabeth Willis, a Mayflower descendant, is buried in O
2 CONC akland Cemetery, Durand, Winnebago Co., IL. His second wife Mary Andrews has a small stone beside Asa's monument. Pliny and Betsey had 12 children, Polly C., Sharlotte E., Rachel, Caleb W., Claricy E., Betsy Maria, Pliney Oakley, 
2 CONC Abel Fayette, William Russell, ASA WILLIS, Harris and Emily Luclia Warren.
