1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna Bishop is named as the first wife of Gideon Warren on his NASDAR record. They were '''married in 1753'''. Her verified children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.) David Bishop Warren Jr., b. ca. 1764, Married Grace Fletcher; (no conflicts).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.)  Asa Warren* was born about ca. 1766 in Vermont. He married Jemima Kellog; there is '''conflicting''' information about Asa's parentage however.  It appears  as Eunice Chipman is claimed to have child Caleb;  there are numerou
2 CONC s citations for Caleb's birth as 1764-1768 in NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.) Caleb Dennis Warren* born '''1763''' West Hoosuck Plantationm, Berkshire Co, Mass; married Rachel Webster. HIs information is the biggest problem. No firm date of birth, place, or mothers. It's all over the place. Also, Anna B
2 CONC ishop, first wife is having David Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gideon and Eunice Chipman ''' married 1773''' per NASDAR records:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.) Elizabeth; no conflicts
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.)''' Caleb Demos/Dennis; * b. 1763 -1768''' at Hampton, NY,  but Caleb's mother is also listed  Eunice Chipman, as Emma Chapman; AND as Anna Bishop. Married Rachel Webster; some records have him born as early as 1760 to Eunice C
2 CONC hipman, which is unlikely as son David, who has no parenting conflicts, isn't born until 1764 to Anna Bishop. One record has him born from Eunice in  1763 at Williamstown, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.) Ammi; b. 1791, New York married Clarissa Ruggles (no conflicts)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.) '''Asa;*''''''b. 1750. Claimed by both mothers on records.'''Another record has him born 1766 in Vermont to Anna. 5.) Sarah b. 1769, VT, married Abijah Webster (no conflicts)
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.) Eliza b. May 15, 1774 at Hampton, NY. Married Elizur Webster. (no conflicts)
2 CONT
2 CONT I looked through all past submissions for these children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More research needs to be done on ASA and CALEB.
2 CONT
