1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/71039460/asa-warren
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Col. Gideon Warren and his first wife Anna Bishop.  .
2 CONT Husband of Jemima Kellogg, with whom he had 9 children, Stephen, Orson, Sylvanus S, Silas, Diadama, Asa Kellogg, Lucy, Hiram and Dr. Ira Warren. .
2 CONT Asa and Jemima separated, and he went to Canada. He died there and is actually buried in the Cassburn Cemetery in the Township of Hawkesbury, on the southern side of the present United Counties of Prescott and Russell---the old Pr
2 CONC escott county.  .
2 CONT Jemima married (2nd) Sylvester Cobb, after whose death she changed her name back to Warren. She died at the home of her youngest son, Dr. Ira Warren in Boston. Asa is memorialized on the Ira Warren monument in the Hanover Center C
2 CONC emetery, where Jemima, Ira, and Ira's wife Ruth Stockbridge Turner are all buried
