1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Abner Brownwell Wood Jr. was born on 30 January 1828, in Sheldon Center, Sheldon, Wyoming, New York, United States, his father, Abner Brownwell Wood, was 43 and his mother, Lucy Blynn Warren, was 31. He marrie
2 CONC d Maria Sylvia Stedman on 17 November 1853, in Livingston, Michigan, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 4 daughters. He lived in United States in 1900 and Muskegon, Michigan, United States in 1906. In 1880,
2 CONC  at the age of 52, his occupation is listed as printer in Corunna, Shiawassee, Michigan, United States. He died on 2 August 1906, in Muskegon, Muskegon, Michigan, United States, at the age of 78.
