1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	Nov. 20, 1788 Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA Death: 	Dec. 7, 1883 Hampton Washington County New York, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John New (b abt 1762 in MA, according to his Rev. War Pension Application) and Salome Russell.  .
2 CONT He married first, on Nov. 7, 1811, in Cornwall, Addison, VT, Lydia Sperry, daughter of Levi Sperry and Lydia Kinney. They had 8 children: John Russell, Alonzo R., Levi Sperry, Charles Jackson, Almina Brewer, Mary Lucretia, Lydia S
2 CONC perry, and Nelson Marcus New.  .
2 CONT He married second, on Jan. 17, 1834 in Hampton, Washington, NY, Mary "Polly" Warren, daughter of Caleb D. Warren and Rachel Webster. Their children were Lucy A. New (who m William Clark) and Veranas Williams New, who died during t
2 CONC he Civil War and is buried at Yorktown National Cemetery , Tomb No. 1399. . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
