1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/22334378/rachel-putney Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel Warren was the daughter of Pliny Price Warren and Betsey Elizabeth Willis. She was born in rural Washington Twp., near Millbrook.  Her descendants are eligible for DAR or SAR membership based on her great grandfather Caleb 
2 CONC Dennis Warren and 2nd great grandfather Col. Gideon Warren. Eligiblity for the Mayflower Society is established through her mother. Betsey Willis was the 5th gr grandaughter of Mary Warren, daughter of Richard Warren. She also qua
2 CONC lifies through Mary Allerton.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hiram (Hite) Putney and they had 11 children, Sharlotte, Thomas (John), Betsey, Plinney O., Rachel Maria, Caroline, Clarissa, Huldah Anna, Isadora, Frederick Hiram and Flora Belle Putney.
2 CONT
