2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Asa Willis Warren was the son of Pliny Price Warren and Betsey Elizabeth Willis. He married Mary Wright, b 1838, Redford, Wayne Co., MI, who is on the same stone, as is Pliny. Betsey Elizabeth Willis Warren is buried in Oakland Ce
2 CONC metery, Durand, Winnebago Co.,IL. Pliny's second wife Mary has a small stone beside Asa's monument. '''Descendants of Asa Willis Warren are eligible for membership in SAR or DAR based on Col Gideon Warren, Asa's gr grandfather, an
2 CONC d Caleb Dennis Warren, Asa's grandfather . They are Mayflower descendants through Betsy Willis ancestors.''' Asa and Mary had 5 children, ABIGAIL ALVIRA Warren, Stoughton Delos Warren, Jessie Belle Warren, Lucy Theodora Warren and
2 CONC  Lewis Clawson (adopted).
2 CONT
2 CONT Asa was the 2nd great grandfather of George Falk.
