1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://books.google.com/books?id=i-NMAQAAMAAJ&pg=PA350&lpg=PA350&dq=kendig+of+swatara&source=bl&ots=BhnCCMhAH_&sig=WjMKbj0FG0xtgOtNNHcGjGIwIDs&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiE9dfxupfMAhXJWj4KHWPQBesQ6AEISDAE#v=onepage&q=
2 CONC kendig&f=false]
2 CONT United States Navy Admiral.
2 CONT
2 CONT Appointed Midshipman from Pennsylvania, November 15, 1809.
2 CONT Commissioned Lieutenant, February 4, 1815.
2 CONT Commissioned Commander, March 3, 1835.
2 CONT Assigned as commander of sloop USS Vandalia, West Indies Squadron, 1837.
2 CONT Commissioned Captain, September 8, 1841, assigned to command frigate USS Brandywine, Brazil Squadron.
2 CONT Assigned to command steam-sloop USS San Jacinto, Mediterranean Squadron, 1852-1853.
2 CONT Assigned to command West Africa Squadron, 1855-1857.
2 CONT Commissioned as Commodore on the Retired List, July 16, 1862.
2 CONT Assigned to United States Navy Prize Commission, Eastern District, Pennsylvania 1864-1865.
2 CONT Commissioned Rear Admiral on the Retired List, July 25, 1866.
