1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I did not create this memorial because I do not believe that find-a-grave memorials should be created for people whose deaths and burials are unknown.   But I inherited it from another Warren family researcher and 
2 CONC can't delete it.  So it exists.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT However, please note:  The marriage record of Jabez and Mary is torn and gives only her maiden name as "Bi - " This has led some people to conjecture that Jabez Warren's wife was Mary Bissel, daughter of Nathaniel Bissel.  Other p
2 CONC eople fervently believe that she was Mary Bishop, and still others that she was Mary Bingham.  But there is not a shred of evidence to prove any of these maiden names - no birth record, no marriage record, no death record, no prob
2 CONC ate record and no land record.  There are no graves for this couple and no tombstones.  So, until a Bible record is found or a bona fide source confirms her identity, I would like to refrain from making any assumptions.  I hope yo
2 CONC u'll agree. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
