1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jemima Kellogg Warren
2 CONT BIRTH	5 Feb 1766, Sheffield, Berkshire County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT DEATH	26 Aug 1853 (aged 87), Boston, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	Hanover Center Cemetery, Hanover, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA, PLOT Sec C, Lot 28, MEMORIAL ID 27453467, Photos by MP
2 CONT
2 CONT After Asa's death, in Canada, she married Sylvester Cobb in 1808. They had no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT And after Sylvester's death in 1839, she went to live with her son, Dr. Ira Warren in Boston and returned to the Warren surname. 
