2 CONT Huldah Gates was born in Richland Co., Ohio on 10 Jan. 1836. Her father was John Gates Jr., born New Jersey, and her mother was Catherine Lewis, born in Pennsylvania.
2 CONT She married Edwin Payne on 10 August 1852 in Richland Co., Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT Huldah Gates died at the age of 95 years 4 mos 6 days on 16 May 1931 at 5:00 pm of old age (senility). She died in her home on Mansfield Avenue in Shelby, Ohio. She had lived in Shelby for 60 years at the time of her death.
