2 CONT William Augustus Crabb, Private in Capt. James Collier's company of the 4th Battalion of Lancaster County Militia commanded by Col. Robert Elder. Enlisted 13 Mar 1776, Discharged about July 1778
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
