2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/42722996/person/28030402244/facts Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 31 2021, 21:00:41 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio:  Daughter of Elizur Webster, Jr., and Elizabeth Warren.  Wife of Elijah Norton.  This couple had eight known children:  Eleanor C, Elizur W, Sylvester B, Henry W, Ferris W, Gary T, Amelia M, and Webster Norton.
2 CONT
2 CONT OBIT:  Mrs. Lucinda Norton, the widow of Col. Elijah Norton, died on Friday last and was buried on Sabbath.  She was the daughter of Judge Webster, the first settler of Warsaw, and was brought here by her parents when but 4 years 
2 CONC of age, and when this whole country was a wilderness.
