2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When Captain John Warren Sr. was born on 19 April 1750, in Woodstock, Windham, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Nathaniel Warren, was 28 and his mother, Althea Grace "Alitheah" Bugbee, was 23. He married A
2 CONC bigail Eaton on 7 May 1778, in Windham, Connecticut, United States. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 25 October 1826, in Tolland, Tolland, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 76, and was b
2 CONC uried in Tolland, Tolland, Connecticut, United States.
