2 CONT
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Persis (Sumner) Warren — married 1783 in Wells, Rutland, Vt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Persis Patty (Warren) Sumner and Marilla Hibbard Warren
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1827 in Thompson Township, Geauga, Ohio, United States
2 CONT
