2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathan was born in 1757. He was the son of Jabez & Susannah (Walker) Warren. He married Persis Sumner and they had eight known children. They were: Persis, Ithamar, Walter, Ebenezer, Nathan, Orrin, Horace & Harriet. According to "
2 CONC A History of the town of Orwell" by Doris Bishop, the family were Baptist. During the war of 1812, Nathan Sr. was in the battle of Plattsburgh, also known as the Battle of Lake Champlain. According to his wife in her application f
2 CONC or a pension, she states that four of her sons were in the same battle; Ithamar, Walter, Nathan Jr. & Orrin.
