1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Ludwig Hart of Charleston Township.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hiram Warren and raised 10 known children in Charleston Township, Tioga County, PA. (from the 1897 History of Tioga County, PA)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children's names were; James, Mary(Furman), Sylvester, Nancy(Teachman), Elijah, Philo S., Solon S., Martha, Alonzo and George.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary's name was on a list of stones found in 1969. Many stones then were buried in the sod, having been laid flat to facilitate mowing.  Another listing was done 2006 and the info listed here was found on Mary's stone. The informa
2 CONC tion here was published in 2008 on joycetice.com.
