2 CONT Advertisement Solon L. Warren  Birth 4 Aug 1840  Charleston, Tioga County, Pennsylvania, USA Death 3 Apr 1924 (aged 83)  Wellsboro, Tioga County, Pennsylvania, USA Burial  Welsh Settlement Cemetery  Charleston, Tioga County, Penns
2 CONC ylvania, USA Add to Map  Memorial ID 89117475 · View Source Share  Save to Suggest Edits Memorial Photos 1 Flowers 1 Veteran Civil War, Private, Battery E, 5th US Light Artillery, enlisted 17 Aug 1863, separated 30 Jan 1866. Son o
2 CONC f Hiram Warren (1799-1878) and Mary Hart (1804-1869). In 1868 married Catherine J. Rowland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:  Albert R. Bert Warren (28 Jul 1869 Charleston, Tioga, PA-15 Jan 1930 West Chatham, PA); 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harry A Warren (15 Aug 1870 Wellsboro, Tioga, PA-7 Jan 1948 Corning, Steuben, NY); 
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Clifford Warren (18 Jan 1874 Wellsboro, PA-Aug 1966 Williamsport, Lycoming, PA); 
