2 CONC New Berne, NC.. Son of Hiram Warren (1799 – 1878) and Mary Hart Warren (1805 – 1869). Married Sarah A Gibbs (1847 – 1922). Parents of: Sherman L. Warren (1866 – ?), Thomas F. Warren (1869 – 1948), Nava E. Warren (1873 – ?), Margar
