2 CONT ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
2 CONT
2 CONT Based on information for James Henry Warren, 1823 - 1900 profiles on familysearch.org  & Ancestry.com, he was married 3 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT First marriage was to Louisa Hurlbut Gibson, 1826 - 1858.  Approximate date of marriage was 1846.  One child was born to this marriage - there may have been more but  no records are provided.  That child was a son, Willard Gibson 
2 CONC Warren, 1854 - 1886.  Louisa passed away in 1858, thus ending the marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT The second marriage was to Mary Ann :"Polly" Weeks, 1831 - 1863.  Approximate date of marriage was 1859.  One child is known to have been born to this marriage, Mary L. Mack (Warren) 1861 - 1933.  Polly Warren (Weeks) passed away 
2 CONC in 1863, thus ending this marriage.  A second child, Murray Warren is listed to this marriage but with no supporting documentation.
2 CONT
2 CONT The third marriage was to Caroline E. Lent, 1826 - 1893.  Approximate date of marriage was 1864.  Two children are known to have been born to this marriage, Gertrude "Gettie" Warren 1865 - 1924 & Susan Orpha Finch (Warren), 1869 -
2 CONC  1948.  A third child, Ann Warren is listed to this marriage but with no supporting documentation.  Caroline E. Warren (Lent) passed away in 1893, most likely still married to James Henry Warren at the time.
2 CONT
2 CONT L. C. Fisher 5 February 2020
2 CONT
