1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reuben son of Daniel and Mabel Hills, baptized 9 May 1762 East Hartford Ct. d 3 March 1818 Hartford Washington Co NY. Married 12 July 1787 Hulda Risley. Heir in father's will, creditor of estate and bought property
2 CONC  from estate.
2 CONT Reuben Hills b 1762 d 1818 Hartford Washington County NY buried Baptist Church cemetery. Served in the American Revolution. Married Huldah Risley abt 1782 with children per probate of of 1818: Reuben, Justin, Ezekiel, Horance. Lau
2 CONC ra (Lorry) and Sophia.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/70023060/reuben-hills Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2022, 21:47:18 UTC''
