2 CONT
2 CONT Joshua was the son of Daniel Hills and Mabel Webster of East Hartford, Connecticut.  He married (1) Glastonbury, CT 2 Sep 1785 Azubah "Zeuby" SIMONDS; m. (2) 1819 Sarah _______. Following his father's 1782 death, Thomas Slater was
2 CONC  chosen as Joshua's guardian. Joshua appears on the 1790 census in E. Hartford, CT; 1810 in Hebron, Washington Co., NY; and 1820 in Truxton, Cortland, NY. He appears to have remarried very soon after the 1818 death of his first wi
2 CONC fe, because a woman of like age is living with him in 1820. Joshua, of Truxton, NY, wrote his will on 10 May 1824, naming wife Sarah among others. The village of Fabius, near where Joshua is buried, is only about five miles from T
2 CONC ruxton, near where he lived.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/58344886/joshua-hills Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2022, 21:47:18 UTC''
