1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (Chicago Tribune; Chicago, IL.  Thursday, October 13, 1927, page 35.)                                                    
2 CONT
2 CONT MISS SARAH L. WEBSTER, 83 years old, aunt of Henry Kitchell Webster, novelist, and a resident of Evanston for more than sixty years, died yesterday at the home of another nephew, Ronald Webster, 911 Lake street, Evanston.  She was
2 CONC  well known in Evanston, having conducted a private school near her home for many years.  Funeral services will be held at 4:30 p.m. tomorrow in the First Baptist church, Evanston.  Burial will be in Ithaca, N.Y.* Reference: [http
