1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Thomas Wilcox=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Stephen Wilcox and Hannah Hazard
2 CONT * Born: 18 Feb 1663/1664 in No. Kingston, Kings Co., Rhode Island. 
2 CONT * Died: 1728 in Exeter, Kings Co., Rhode Island.
2 CONT * Thomas Wilcox was of Kingston, RI in 1710 and on May 17 of that year, bought, with others, 2000 acres of vacant land ordered sold by the assembly. His will was proved Apr. 9, 1728 and by it he gave to his seven sons land in equa
2 CONC l divisions and to his wife the stock and household goods and Negro man, also the housing until the youngest son, Edward was of age, when she was to have the best room.  Transcribed from: recopied by Kate Wilcox Thorsen 4/26/1980 
2 CONC Researched & copied by Agnes Wilcox Limas 9 May, 1958 for Jeffrey Wilcox
2 CONT * CLIPPED FROM Newport Mercury Newport, Rhode Island on 24 Feb 1906, Sat  •  Page 8
2 CONT * [https://archive.org/details/hazardfamilyofrh00byurobi?view=theater#page/12/mode/2up '''The Hazard Family of Rhoad Island page 39''']
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003940052716?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000081492056409 '''Martha HAZARD,'''] on May 17, 1710 in Exeter RI, Colonial America birth about 1668 in Portsmouth, Newport Co.,
2 CONC  Rhode Island; died bef. 1753 in Exeter, Kings Co., Rhode Island.  Thomas and his wife Martha Hazard were first cousins. Thomas' mother Hannah Hazard Wilcox and Martha's father Robert Hazard Sr. were siblings. Also Thomas' brother
2 CONC  Edward married Thomas' wife's sister Mary Hazard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003940052716&photo_id=6000000173012152002&position=0 Children Listed by The Colonial Families of the USA From 1607-1775 for Edward Wilcox From The Colonial Famil
2 CONC ies of the United States of America, Volume III .]
2 CONT
2 CONT *  '''Jeffrey WILCOX''' was born 1690 in North Kingston, Kings Co., Rhode Island. He died 1759 in New Hampshire. Jeffrey married Sarah HIMES, daughter of James HYMES and Sarah SPINK, on 24 Apr 1726 in Westerly, Kings Co., Rhode Is
2 CONC land. Sarah was born 1706.
2 CONT * '''Stephen WILCOX''' was born about 1692 in North Kingston, Kings Co., Rhode Island. He died Feb 1766 in East Greenwich, Kent Co., Rhode Island. Married Elizabeth Crandall
2 CONT *  '''Thomas WILCOX''' was born 24 Oct 1693 in North Kingston, Kings Co., Rhode Island. He died before 18 Feb 1760. Thomas married (1) Anne HIMES. Anne was born 1708 in North Kingston, Kings Co., Rhode Island. She died before 3 Ma
2 CONC r 1744. Thomas also married (2) Abigail ARNOLD. Abigail was born about 1723 in Exeter, Kings Co., Rhode Island. She died after 12 Jan 1760.
2 CONT *  '''Robert WILCOX''' was born about 1698.
2 CONT *  '''Abraham WILCOX''' was born 1707 and died 23 May 1807. Abraham married Lydia HARRINGTON
2 CONT *  '''George WILCOX''' was born in Exeter, Kings Co., Rhode Island. George married Margaret.
2 CONT *  '''Edward WILCOX''' was born about 1709. Married  (1)  Marcy Mary Robinson, (2) Esther Sheffield;
2 CONT *  '''Hannah WILCOX''' was born about 1717.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003940052716&photo_id=6000000152662633016&position=0 Will of Thomas Wilcox, dated April 9, 1728, by The Genealogical Dictionary of Rhode Island: Comprising Three
2 CONC  Generations of ... By John Osborne Austin, page 423]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003940052716&photo_id=6000000152662702861&position=0 The Genealogical Dictionary of Rhode Island: Comprising Three Generations of ... By John Osborne Austin, pag
2 CONC e 423]
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
