2 CONT * narragansett-historical-register-v-2.pdf 99/ 341 - https://onerhodeislandfamily.files.wordpress.com/2012/05/narragansett-historical-register-v-2.pdf
2 CONT * https://occgs.com/projects/rescue/compiled/Richard%20Porter%20Research/HAZARD_BABCOCK_LAWTON.pdf
