2 CONT * Wilcox, William Alonzo. Wilcox-Brown-Medbery genealogy. Scranton, Pa. : Printed for the Author, 1902. p.6
2 CONT * Robinson, Caroline E. The Hazard Family of Rhode Island 1635-1894. Boston, Printed by the Author: (1895)
