2 CONT * CR - Baptism; 26 Dec 1634; Orby, Lincoln, Eng 10. Baptized on St. Stephen's Day 
2 CONT * Colony Office; 1670; Rhode Island 11. Served as Representative 
2 CONT * Colony Office; 1672; Westerly, Washington Co., RI 11. Served as Representative 
2 CONT * Lands Recorded - Granted; 10 Dec 1657; Portsmouth, Newport Co., RI 11. Received a grant of land with Thomas Kent at 2s per acre 
2 CONT * Lands Recorded - Gifted; 30 Jan 1657/58; Portsmouth, Newport Co., RI 11. Received a deed for 34 acres from Thomas Hazard as dower for the latter's daughter Hannah. 
2 CONT * Residence; 18 May 1669; Westerly, Washington Co., RI 11. Listed among the inhabitants of the town. 
2 CONT * Lands Recorded; 21 Jun 1670; Stonington, New London, CT 11. He was complained of, with his partakers, by John Richards, Treasurer of Harvard College, for unjustly possessing 500 acres in Pequot country, east side of the Pawcatuc
2 CONC k River, within the bounds of Stonington. 
2 CONT * Colony Office; Between 1670-1672; Westerly, Washington Co., RI 11. Served as Deputy 
2 CONT * VR - Death; Bef 6 Feb 1689/90; Westerly, Washington Co., RI 11. Mentioned as of 6 Feb 1690 as lately deceased.
