1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Edward Wilcox=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Youngest son of Thomas Wilcox and Martha Hazard
2 CONT * Edward Wilcox, Birth Date: 1709, Birth Place: Exeter, Washington, Rhode Island, USA, 
2 CONT * Death:	1782 (65) in Charlestown, RI, United States
2 CONT * '''Place of Burial:'''	[https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003940072503?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000090148628895&position=0 '''North side of Post Road in Westerly, RI 48'''] 
2 CONT * [http://rihistoriccemeteries.org/newgravedetails.aspx?ID=449691 '''RHODE ISLAND VETERANS MEMORIAL'''] 
