2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003940072503?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000173794064849 '''Edward Willcox in the Rhode Island, U.S., Compiled Census and Census Substitutes Index, 1740-1890''']
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003940072503?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000198301574853 '''U.S., Revolutionary War Rolls, 1775-1783 for Eward Wilcox, Rhode Island Crarys Regiment, 1777-1779 (Folder 45) - Variou
2 CONC s Organizations (Folder 66).''']
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003940072503&photo_id=6000000198302003834&position=0 '''Colonial Families of the USA, 1607-1775 for Edward Wilcox Colonial Families of the United States of Ameri
2 CONC ca, Volume III Hazard Family.''']
