2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Hannah (Cole) Place''' was born on January 17, 1666 in Boston, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, British Colonial America. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-77750094 John Cole] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-109059
2 CONC 28 Susanna (Hutchinson) Cole]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-22050312 Thomas Place, Jr.] in 1694 in Boston, Suffolk Co., MA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-50899555 Mary (Place) Kenyon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-28475048 John Place]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-28475002 Marbury (Place) Stafford]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-22050262 Thomas Place, Jr.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-28475105 Joseph Place]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-28475080 Sarah Place]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-94907539 Enoch Place, III]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-50900694 Samuel Place]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-28475126 Ann Place]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-50799024 Unknown Place]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1734 in North Kingston,Washington,Rhode Island, British Colonial America. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Austin ''Genealogical Dictionary of Rhode Island'' provides the following information regarding the family of Thomas Place: Thomas Place married Hannah (Cole) Place (1668-1734), daughter of John & Susanna (Hutchinson) Cole; [4] Th
2 CONC omas and Hannah were the parents of the following children: [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mary; 5 Jan 169_.
2 CONT # Marbury; 5 May 169_
2 CONT # Thomas, 2 Nov 169_.
2 CONT # John, 24 April 170_.
2 CONT # Sarah; 10 May 170_
2 CONT # Joseph; 22 Dec 170_
2 CONT # Samuel, Sep 170_
2 CONT # Enoch
2 CONT # Ann
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
