2 CONT     Notes from Mary Lou Clegg:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Thomas Place, born 1663 in Kingstown, RI; died 1727. He married Hannah Cole; born 17 Dec 1668 in Boston, MA; died bet. 1727 - 1734 in North Kingstown, RI.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Will proved 20 Nov 1727 North Kingstown RI.
2 CONT
2 CONT     The American Genealogist, January/April 2004 pp. 76-81. Two Thomas Places
2 CONT     of North Kingstown, RI. Corrections to Arnold's Vital Record of Rhode Island
2 CONT     by the late Gerald James Parsons, FASG.
