2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Her fire-damaged birth record in North Kingstown says "(---)urye Place was born the 5th day of May 169(---)." An article in The American Genealogist posits the year was 1695 based on circumstantial evidence. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was called "Marbury Stafford" in her father's will of 1727."[2]
