2 CONT * Justin Durand, "[https://www.yellacatranch.com/solomon-place-bible/ Solomon Place Bible]", Yellacat Ranch <yellacatranch.com>, Aug. 13, 2025. Retrieved Aug. 23, 2025.
2 CONT * Findagrave.com [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GSln=place&GSfn=solomon&GSbyrel=in&GSdyrel=in&GSob=n&GRid=57877080&df=all& Gen. Solomon Place]
