1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Peleg Place''' was born on November 13, 1778 in Rhode Island, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-17103522293 Enoch Place, IV] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673811688 Ruth Hammond]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peleg married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34689925307 Hannah (Lewis) Place]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34689925353 Dr. Simon Gardiner Place]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-3468992533
2 CONC 7 Phebe (Place) Stanton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34689925370 Sally T (Place) Dorrance]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 26, 1849 in Foster, Providence County, Rhode Island, United States. 
2 CONT ----
