1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the "History of the John H. Place Family Homestead and Adjoining Farms with other interesting facts", by John W. Place, May, 1944, and "The Place Ancestry of John Warren Place , 3rd" by John W. Place - October
2 CONC  1946
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Place married Sally Gibbs. They lived on the farm (later owned by Charles M. Perry in 1946) at Rice City from 1805 to 1814 and at Moosup Valley (where Herbert Dexter lived in 1946) the remainder of their lives.
