2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died intestate on 19 December 1747 in Warwick, Rhode Island.[1] His inventory was taken on 8 February 1747/48.[1] Mrs. Elizabeth Tiffany is the administrator of his estate and also made an oath on the personal estate.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Estate Account was presented on 10 February 1752 to the Warwick Town Council.[2] Elizabeth was paid for the maintenance of her children, Elizabeth, Benjamin and Asa (daughter)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Tiffany-30
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 26 Feb 2022 | Created 15 May 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Tiffany (1702 - 1747)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Benjamin Tiffany===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1702 in Town of Attleborough, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
