2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT Erected in memory of Mrs. Bathsheba Crane wife of Mr. Henry Crane who died January the 3rd AD 1807 in the 99th year of her age
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gravesite Details'''
2 CONT Her age would make her born in 1707/08. Bathsheba had two sisters, Lydia born in 1707 and another name unknown bornin 1709. Refer to the book, Representative Men and Old Families of Rhode Island,Volume 1, page 1654
