2 CONC Martha, and Ann. Their eight sons were John, Humphrey, Noah, Hosea, Thomas, Abijah, Zechariah, and Hezekiah. Hezekiah is buried at Bushnell Cemetery in Sodus, Wayne County, New York (Find A Grave Memorial# 23114722).
