1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Eunice (Shaw) Place''' was born on December 15, 1806 in New York, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-109263013 Cornelius Shaw] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-109263080 Susan Shaw]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eunice married [https://www.geni.com/profile-94906514 Thomas Place] in 1829. Together they had the following children: 
2 CONT * 1830 [https://www.geni.com/profile-94906393 William Thomas Place]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-94906423 Catherine Elizabeth STOTTS]
2 CONT * 1832 [https://www.geni.com/profile-38904917 Thomas Washington Place]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34675403500 Rebecca Jane EASTER]
2 CONT * 1834 [https://www.geni.com/profile-38906549 Amelia Abigail Place]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38905907 Alonzo CRAWFORD]
2 CONT * 1837 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34675403807 Abby A. Place]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34675405032 Calvin GOODRICH] 
2 CONT * 1839 [https://www.geni.com/profile-38906192 Jerome H Place]; 
2 CONT * 1841 [https://www.geni.com/profile-38905449 Delilah Isabelle Place]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721700086 David MORRISON] 
2 CONT * 1844 [https://www.geni.com/profile-38906225 Daniel Clay Place] married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38905915 Jane Helen BENSON]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 7, 1871 in Fairfield, Huron, Ohio, USA and was buried circa July 10, 1871 in Old North Fairfield Cemetery (Plot Row 12 Grave Lot# 3), North Fairfield, Huron County, Ohio, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT == Source ==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Findagrave.com, [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=13755553 Eunice Shaw Place]
2 CONT * Reference: [https://findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;GRid=13755553 Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 8 2017, 7:41:41 UTC''
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1850 - Corinth, Saratoga, New York, United States
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1850 - Fairfield, Huron, Ohio, United States
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1855 - Hadley, Saratoga, New York, United States
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1860 - Town of Hadley, Saratoga, New York, United States
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1870 - Ohio, United States
2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-961397668/eunice-place-born-shaw-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 4 2018, 3:32
2 CONC :35 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT =Disambiguation=
2 CONT Do NOT confuse with [https://www.geni.com/people/Eunice-Place/6000000002228953617 Eunice HOLDEN] 1807-1870, daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Elihu-Holden/6000000041949129105 Elihu HOLDEN]  and [https://www.geni.com/people/
2 CONC Abigail-Foster/6000000002228899425 Abigail FOSTER] married [https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Place/6000000220856148833 Thomas PLACE]
2 CONT
2 CONT NOT the mother of https://www.geni.com/people/Cornelia-Mitchell/6000000079889581375 1843-1883 who married https://www.geni.com/people/Elias-Mitchell/6000000079889933432, she is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Pl
