1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/63895913/person/36116762527 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 21 2019, 0:17:13 UTC''
