1 NOTE Lillian Lucy Roth
2 CONT The following are exerpts abstracted from the obituary for Lillian
2 CONT (Roth)
2 CONT Payne which appeared in the Shelby Daily Globe 28 May 1948:
2 CONT Lillian Payne Dies Suddenly
2 CONT Mrs. Lillian Payne died suddenly Thursday at 5 p.m. at the family
2 CONT home...She was a member of the First Church of Christ. Survivors
2 CONT include eight
2 CONT sons: Charles, Harold, Roy, Edwin, Walter, Herbert, and Ned, all of
2 CONT Shelby,
2 CONT and John of Lakewood, Ohio; two daughters: Mrs. Laura Irey and Mrs.
2 CONT Phyllis
2 CONT Tarvin; two brothers: Charles Roth and Jerry Roth; and three sisters:
2 CONT Mrs.
