1 NOTE Charles Carleton Payne
2 CONT Charles Payne served in the United States Marine Corps during World
2 CONT War I. He enlisted in Cleveland, Ohio on 29 July 1918 and was sent to
2 CONT France on 3 Nov 1918 where, on 21 Nov 1918, he was attached to the 66
2 CONT Co 5 Reg. He is listed as a member of the AEF from 3 Nov 1918 - 25
2 CONT July 1919. He served in the Army of Occupation and was discharged at
2 CONT Quantico, VA on 13 Aug 1919.
