1 NOTE Ned Payne enlisted in the U.S. Army in 1943. He was attached to
2 CONT Battery B of the 770th Artillery Battalion and trained in Brownwood,
2 CONT Texas and Fort Hood. On D-Day, he was with the invading troops and
2 CONT went ashore on Utah Beach. He fought in the Battle of the Bulge
2 CONT He was the chief cook for the unit.
2 CONT This information is from Captain Alan Layton, Captain of Battalion
2 CONT 770 Battery B.
