1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/42722996/person/342461527107 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 10 2023, 20:51:26 UTC''
2 CONT
