2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN SMALLWOOD, son of William and Mary Smallwood, was born in Yorkshire, England, February 15th, 1811; came to America in 1819 and to Ripley in 1838. September 20th, 1837, he married Harriet J. Webster, of Ripley, who died March 
2 CONC 30th, 1875. He has been excise commissioner seven years. His father, William Smallwood, was born in Yorkshire, England, in 1777 and died May 21st, 1867. He came to America in 1819 and lived in Warren, N. Y., until his death. His w
2 CONC ife was born in England in 1775 and died December 9th, 1864. Hon. Elizur Webster, Mr. Smallwood's father-in-law, was born in Connecticut, August 24th, 1767, and married Elizabeth Warren, born May 15th, 1774.
