1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Adelia "Delia"  (Smallwood) Brownell was the daughter of John and Harriet Jennet (Webster) Smallwood.  She was the wife of Rev. John Thomas Brownell.  They were married  Ripley,  New York November 10, 1864.  H
2 CONC e was a minister in the East Genesee Conference/Genesee Conference and  Central New York Conference of the Methodist Episcopal Church.  
