1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3rd of 11 children of Capt. EBENEZER SUMNER & PERSIS PEASE
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Aug 1783, NATHAN WARREN, Wells, Rutland Co., Vermont Note: Nathan is a son of JABEZ WARREN, II & SUSANNA WALKER 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eight children: 1. Persis Patty WARREN  1785 – 1861  2. Ithamer "Thomas" WARREN 1787 – 1872  3. Walter WARREN  1788 – 1865  4. Ebenezer WARREN  1790 – 1828  5. Nathan WARREN  1793 – 1847  6. Orrin WARREN  1795 – 1840  7. Horace Au
2 CONC stin WARREN 1799 – 1872 8. Harriet M. WARREN 1801 - 1872
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/32245646/persis-warren Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 7 2019, 12:51:16 UTC''
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Sumner-1228
2 CONT
2 CONT Persis (Patty) Warren formerly Sumner
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 30 Dec 1761 in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Ebenezer Sumner and Persis (Pease) Sumner
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Ebenezer Sumner, Sarah (Sumner) Johnson and	Daniel Ollis Sumner
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Nathan Warren — married 1783 in Wells, Rutland, Vt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Persis Patty (Warren) Sumner and Marilla Hibbard Warren
2 CONT
2 CONT Died after 29 Mar 1855 in Thompson Township, Geauga, Ohio, United States  [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 11 Jan 2019 | Created 12 Apr 2015
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Persis Warren was married to Nathan Warren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
