2 CONC cestry.com (Online Database). Appleton, William Sumner, Record of the Descendants of William Sumner, of Dorchester, Mass., 1636, Boston: David Clapp and Son, Printers (1879), 38, Google Books (Digital Library). Meggison, Michael T
