1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Buried 26 Mar 1861; 76 years of age.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Husband MAY be Ira B. Sumner.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT In the 1860 Federal Census, Persis Sumner (Vermont) is living in the house of Horace Ornsby (Vermont) in Beloit, Wisconsin.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Ancestry list a Persis Patty Warren with same dates as this Percis Sumner.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Persis Sumner Memorial #150768639 Persis Warren Sumner is my 4xgreat grandmother, daughter of Nathan Warren (Jabez Warren/Susannah Walker) and Persis Sumner (Ebenezer Sumner/Persis Pease). I have sent as many corrections as I coul
2 CONC d. Unfortunately, her husband Azor Betts Sumner (not Ira) has no memorial as his burial site is unknown- it is most certainly NOT Point Moniteau, MO as noted in Appleton's Sumner work. I think I will have to create a memorial for 
2 CONC him like I did for another ancestor of mine from this branch. Added by D. Larocque (#46972851) on Apr 27, 2017. 
2 CONT ----
