2 CONT >In August of 1783 Nathan Warren married Persis Sumner, and they had 8 known children: Persis, Ithamer, Walter, Ebenezer, Nathan Jr., Orrin, Horace & Harriet. According to "A History of the Town of Orwell, VT" by Doris Bishop, the
2 CONC  family was Baptist. 
